{"unit_id":"framecy__dsh-ssh-shell#card-zh","repo":"framecy/dsh-ssh-shell","commit":"9f686533612dd9a5fa8bd0ce34e77e9120d2993e","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ssh-shell 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的 SSH 远程终端插件，通过 DSH 工具和右侧浮动浏览器面板连接远程主机。它用持久 OpenSSH ControlMaster 管理会话，并以 WebSocket 将真实 PTY 接到浏览器。用户可以建立连接、查看状态、执行远程命令，也能在交互式面板中输入按键并读取输出；会话支持后台命令与断线后有限重连。适合需要从 DSH 管理远程主机或使用 SSH 交互终端的场景。需要 OpenSSH、sshpass；图形终端面板还需要 node-pty 和 ws。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1010-1019","lib/index.js:897-918","lib/index.js:1279-1330","lib/client.js:406-423"]}
{"unit_id":"framecy__dsh-ssh-shell#card-en","repo":"framecy/dsh-ssh-shell","commit":"9f686533612dd9a5fa8bd0ce34e77e9120d2993e","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-ssh-shell adds SSH to DSH through model tools and a floating browser terminal. OpenSSH ControlMaster keeps sessions available, and WebSocket connects a real PTY to the panel. Users can run remote commands and interact with terminal output. Requires OpenSSH, sshpass, node-pty, and ws.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1010-1019","lib/index.js:897-918","lib/index.js:1279-1330","lib/client.js:406-423"]}
