{"unit_id":"framecy__dsh-ssh-shell#feature-1","repo":"framecy/dsh-ssh-shell","commit":"9f686533612dd9a5fa8bd0ce34e77e9120d2993e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ssh-shell 的功能「远程 SSH 命令」：连接远程主机后可查询会话、执行命令或关闭连接。通过 ssh_remote 工具提交目标和命令，执行结果返回输出与退出状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1010-1019","lib/index.js:1100-1120"]}
