{"unit_id":"framecy__dsh-ssh-shell#feature-3","repo":"framecy/dsh-ssh-shell","commit":"9f686533612dd9a5fa8bd0ce34e77e9120d2993e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ssh-shell 的功能「后台命令输出」：对话工具可将远程命令作为后台任务启动并返回任务编号，之后读取增量输出或停止任务。适合需要等待较久的远程操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:1016-1017","lib/index.js:1160-1190"]}
{"unit_id":"framecy__dsh-ssh-shell#feature-4","repo":"framecy/dsh-ssh-shell","commit":"9f686533612dd9a5fa8bd0ce34e77e9120d2993e","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-ssh-shell 的功能「断线后重连」：浏览器面板连接中断时会按固定间隔尝试恢复，最多重试三次；用户也可以手动停止重连或再次发起连接。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:406-423","lib/client.js:473-475"]}
